	(text "Pinout = keyboard/hardware/design/nets.py SLOT_PINS (SPEC §4.2), seen from the coupon: odd pins one row,\neven pins the other; a GND opposite every lane. PRESENT_N (32) is strapped to GND, RSV (39) is open.\nMounted on the bottom, pins down into the motherboard's 8.5 mm socket (SPEC §9). Not hot-plugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
